      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `dcd9252b8c882aed66086ed1501cd856088187e516c3d58dc5eb9debc43c9a34--45300do011_200809.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Crime Victimisation, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2008-09\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 8 of 8\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 693bc3bc73ec4e1120e8ed0e134040a0b5313acd120a692e006766b7317e55b6 | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | 0961a7309b384f328a1aa44e1e969177a6268b5f88b3f9cc24fed64c8efb2897 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | 91dcd254b87397c5ca8d8666ef8211bf8da7a4235369cbd1815acc9465118504 | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | 93d34c3a86bfedca39a7afa63c8bca62d7fc2cab42bf3ccddeed423c37e77e68 | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | 3c32d0d6ed17c00a0ed98e5f783923fa2642e600e9a989fe3a1707a0f3197fb8 | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | d18b44273c548f9a9c6e2df665507577c0fbc90e52232c84cdb9152378ce97c3 | missing |\n| \"Table_6\" | 58ce06e402bc9e012abbe44b682a7350bfad5c7590f60d99157f68e77feda6b4 | missing |\n| \"Table_7\" | 4282eecb7090bce01b8eef4e248993d1af94a5cb04f870e9af1855e98e8ceb62 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
